{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, move, take it, check props, complete task, return back, or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsTaskStarted    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToStartPoint    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
